  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rea 102.01 Description of Agency.\n\n(a) The commission consists of 5 members appointed by the governor with the advice and consent of the council pursuant to RSA 331-A:5.\n\n(b) Its functions include the examination and licensing of persons applying for salesperson or broker status, and the regulation of salespersons and brokers.\n\nSource. #2130, eff 8-30-82; ss by #2847, eff 9-19-84, EXPIRED: 9-19-90\n\nNew. #5567, eff 2-11-93, EXPIRED: 2-11-99\n\nNew. #7160, INTERIM, eff 12-18-99, EXPIRED: 4-16-00\n\nNew. #7262, eff 5-6-00; ss by #14237, eff 4-16-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/rea100-700.html"
